      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this is a non-actionable bug report.\n\nOP's minimum performance rating to display has been set to Very Poor (which is unbounded), with a maximum 200 MB download size. OP is playing on a laptop in VR mode. The logs also state two private avatars created by have been loaded into the scene.\n\navatar_perf_rating_VeryPoor has a mean 0.99819 value for the user-created avatar `avtr_15c8deb0-8711-41d5-ac0f-2596bde32d40` (mfhrrjrn by zackwolf56) OP is wearing. The highest load is on the CPU, according to cpu_frame_time.\n\nThe world loaded (Autumn Refuge) is also user-created content.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
